# It runs a query

<query>SELECT * FROM './'</query>
<baseline>find . -maxdepth 1 -type f</baseline>
<ms>
  <max>500</max>
  <mean>50</mean>
</ms>

```bash
dirsql $query
```

## Python

<baseline>python -c "import os; list(os.scandir('.'))"</baseline>
<ms>
  <max>200</max>
</ms>

```python
dirsql = DirSQL()
await dirsql.query("$query")
```
